; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1662  ** Description     : This API initializes the PLLs and other MCU specific     **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1663  **                   clock options. The PLL lock procedure is started (if PLL **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1664  **                   shall be initialized) for system and peripheral PLLs,    **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1665  **                   but the function does not wait until the peripheral PLL  **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1666  **                   is locked                                                **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1667  **                   Note: Mcu_InitClock only initializes the PLL parameters. **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1668  **                         PLL clock will be activated to the MCU distribution**
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1669  **                         only after the system PLL is also locked and then  **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  1670  **                         Mcu_DistributePllClock shall be called. i.e The    **
